Our data and write-up (the model outputs, labels, derived tables, run records and analysis
outputs under ad-library/data/, agent-feeds/runs/, agent-feeds/artifacts/,
agent-feeds/exploration/, brand-associations/data/ and brand-associations/output/, plus
results/, my-takeaways.md and the docs/ folders) are licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Third-party material is not ours to license and is not covered by the above:

- Ad metadata (ad IDs, advertiser names, dates, impression counts, targeting fields, ad text,
  media URLs) captured from the Snap Ads Gallery, the Microsoft Advertising (Bing) Ad Library and
  the TikTok Commercial Content Library remains subject to those libraries' terms of use. The
  ad creatives themselves are not included.
- Wikipedia text in brand-associations/data/derived/assoc/documents_wikipedia.jsonl is
  CC BY-SA 4.0 (Wikipedia contributors); the Wikimedia clickstream extracts are CC0.
- News headlines, article URLs and short quoted spans in brand-associations/data/ belong to
  their publishers and are included only as research metadata.
- Google Trends series are Google's data, subject to Google's terms.
- The Wikimedia Commons images used as primes are not included; their authors and licences are
  recorded per image in agent-feeds/config/stimuli/*.json.
